  - Ergonomic stacking geometry: curved chevron vs flush bands to prevent stone rubbing and prong loosening.

##### Competitor URL Analysis (`caratlane.com`):
CaratLane focuses heavily on romantic engagement lore and provides high-level left vs right hand comparisons for brides and grooms. However, it completely conflates engagement rings with marriage rings, omits gold alloy durability guidance for lifetime wear, provides zero hallmarking or verification details, and neglects knuckle sizing and band contour ergonomics.

